# Coverage Map

> This is the English translation of [coverage.md.template](./coverage.md.template). The Chinese version is the source of truth.
>
> This file is the workspace coverage source of truth. Researched companies belong here; `coverage-monitor` consumes it for daily briefs and intraday alerts.

## Coverage Contract

| Field | Values | Contract |
|---|---|---|
| Coverage | Core / Building / Radar | Core = sustained core workstream; Building = company-level coverage started; Radar = tracked candidate |
| Monitor | Core / Daily | Core = daily company news + movers + industry tape; Daily = daily quote scan + industry tape, company news only on mover/trigger |

